# Reuse And Extraction

Favor extraction only when reuse is real and boundaries stay clear.

## Rule

- Extract shared logic/UI when used in 2 or more surfaces (routes, blocks, or layouts).
- Keep one-off logic in local route scope until reuse is proven.
- Prefer thin wrappers at route/block boundaries that delegate to shared modules.
- Do not duplicate nearly identical implementations across routes.

## Preferred Pattern

1. Keep route-level data/query handling in the route.
2. Normalize data shape in a mapper utility.
3. Render via a shared presentational module.
